WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:03.240
[MYSTERIOUS MUSIC]

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.830
I'm sorry I hurt you.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.620
For Jericho, there is 
nothing I wouldn't do, nothing.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.930
He's part of me.

00:00:11.931 --> 00:00:13.050
Do you understand?

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.500
You can lock me in now.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.920
Lisa Brühlmann, who directed 
in the first season as well,

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.220
directed this episode.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.080
You scared me, what you did.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.950
I know, harming her.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.140
I know I went way too far.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.900
She has great, great instincts.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.980
And she has a kind of 
intimacy of performance,

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.590
but a very different, 
off-kilter point of view.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.750
And I want to celebrate that.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.340
You don't give them the bag, 
until they hand over the baby.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.620
And you don't let 
her out of your sight.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:46.120
Go get him.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.520
You know, this season, season two,

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.780
I think the two female 
characters are really

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.570
where the action is for us.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.840
So having female directors 
come in and defend them

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.420
in the right way was a 
powerful thing for our show.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.780
It's called a King Cake.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.750
My mother used to make it on Sundays.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.400
She taught me how.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:07.800
This episode's also about 
Leanne's history and her mother

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.420
and a lot of Leanne's 
behavior is tied to that.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.010
She said whoever was most 
special would get the baby.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.040
We get to learn a little 
bit about what happened to her.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:20.360
And who is this mother?

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:22.610
And maybe she didn't have the best mother.

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:24.180
She always found the baby.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.410
She would hold it up in her
hand for me to see it.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.210
And then, she'd make me say it.

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:32.960
You're the special one!

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.540
She's reliving it and 
changing the ending of it,

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:38.360
becoming very powerful and 
using her anger, saying,

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.200
I'm no longer going to be the victim.

